<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Durban Deep lifts Sept qtr net profit.</title>
<headline>Durban Deep lifts Sept qtr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending   8.43 vs 8.17</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   5.13 vs 2.78</p>
<p>Tonnes milled</p>
<p>	- Underground			 137,000 vs 130,000</p>
<p>	- Surface			     275,000 vs 286,000</p>
<p>Gold output (kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			     594 vs 580</p>
<p>	- Surface				   130 vs 145</p>
<p>Yield (gram/t)</p>
<p>	- Underground			    4.34 vs 4.46</p>
<p>	- Surface				  0.47 vs 0.51</p>
<p>Cost (ran /kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			  47,163 vs 46,447</p>
<p>	- Surface				46,787 vs 41,572</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			55,467 vs 54,481</p>
<p>Full name: Durban Roodepoort Deep Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
